" Toolroll  · shop  $1.84 today · plan 62%                                                     ◐ 2 working   2 need you  "
"  ╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮   "
" ╭│ j/k            Move in list / scroll panel              x              Stop the build, or its retries           │─╮ "
" ││ Left/Right     Focus list / panel                       X              Cancel task (asks first)                 │ │ "
" ││ Tab/Shift-Tab  Next / previous tab                      a              Accept the result, or approve a plan     │ │ "
" ││ !/@            Next / previous that needs you           r              Send back with a note; retry if failed   │ │ "
" ││ '              Jump back (again: forward)               t              Open build shell                         │ │ "
" ││ PgUp/PgDn      Scroll up / down                         n              New task                                 │ │ "
" ││ End            Follow the newest                        T              New thread                               │─┤ "
" ││ L              Next layout (one, two or four panels)    /              Filter list / search focused pane        │ │ "
" ││ o/O            Next / previous pane                     Ctrl-E         Open this pane in $EDITOR                │ │ "
" ││ </>            Narrower / wider list (or split)         :              Every action, task and setting           │ │ "
" ││ =              Even splits, usual list width            y              Copy to your terminal's scrollback       │ │ "
" ││ b              List: full, rail, hidden                 w              Open Toolroll in your browser            │ │ "
" ││ z              Zoom the focused panel                   ?              These keys                               │ │ "
" ││ ⏎              Open & focus changes, else live output   q              Quit                                     │ │ "
" ││ s              Steer: send the running agent a note     A              Agents: add, sign in, choose models      │ │ "
" ││ p              Pause the build, or ask for a plan                                                               │ │ "
" ││ In Diff                                                                                                         │ │ "
" ││ j/k            Next / previous line                     c              A note on the line or hunk               │ │ "
" ││ Home           First line of the file                   Backspace      Remove the note here                     │ │ "
" ││ ]/[            Next / previous hunk                     e/E            More lines above / below the hunk        │ │ "
" ││ }/{            Next / previous file                     v              Side by side (a wide window)             │ │ "
" ││ n/N            Next / previous note                                                                             │ │ "
" ││ 1-9            Answer the agent's question              Ctrl-]         Leave a terminal you are typing in       │ │ "
" ││ Esc            Cancel, close, or go back                Ctrl-C         Quit                                     │ │ "
" ││ Keys: the default preset. Change any in tui.toml under [keys], e.g. preset = "vim" or accept = "f2".            │ │ "
" ╰│ Press s for settings, any other key to close.                                                                   │─╯ "
